algorithms.pseudocode:
Input: theory graph G, source s, target t
queue = [(s, [])]
visited = {s}
while queue not empty:
  (current, path) = dequeue()
  for morphism m from current:
    next = m.target
    if next not in visited:
      if next == t: return path + [m]
      visited.add(next)
      enqueue((next, path + [m]))
return None

Time: O(V+E), Space: O(V)
